WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.490
Eco-friendly.

2
00:00:01.540 --> 00:00:02.790
Recyclable.

3
00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:03.970
Natural.

4
00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:07.630
A label can make a product sound
green while you are using it.

5
00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:09.430
But before it reached you,

6
00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:12.350
that product had to be
made from raw materials.

7
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:15.210
And one day, it will be thrown away.

8
00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:18.330
Something that looks clean in
your hand might have cost a lot

9
00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:21.170
of energy to make, or to get rid of.

10
00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:24.590
So how do you judge a
product's whole impact?

11
00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:27.990
In this mission, you'll follow
a product through every stage of

12
00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:31.820
its life, from the raw materials
to the day it is thrown away.

13
00:00:31.870 --> 00:00:34.250
You'll carry out a
life cycle assessment,

14
00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:38.530
and see how recycling can
save resources and energy.

15
00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:41.290
Your mission: judge a
product's whole impact,

16
00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:43.530
from start to finish.
